<div class="ev-body"><span class="tag">Hosting</span><h2>L2 Coventry Orange and Green Belt Competition</h2><p>A Level 2 development event for players graded 7th to 12th mon, aged 8 to 16 on the day. Open weight, with players sorted into pools of 6 to 8 by age, weight and experience. A friendly first taste of competition.</p><dl><div><dt>Venue</dt><dd>Sports Connexion, Leamington Road, Ryton-on-Dunsmore, CV8 3FL</dd></div><div><dt>Weigh-in</dt><dd>Girls 9.00–9.30am · Boys under 50kg 10.00–10.30am · Boys over 50kg 12.30–1.00pm</dd></div><div><dt>Entry</dt><dd>£20 · Closes Thursday 17 September 2026 or when full</dd></div></dl><a class="btn" href="https://www.britishjudo.org.uk/event/l2-coventry-orange-and-green-belt-competition/">Enter via British Judo <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div>
